  "title": "AbstractDataStore",
  "meta": {},
  "body": "<section id=\"abstractdatastore\"><h1>AbstractDataStore</h1><dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"store.abstract.AbstractDataStore\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">store.abstract.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">AbstractDataStore</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Generic</span></code>[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#store.abstract.T\" title=\"store.abstract.T\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">T</span></code></a>], <code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">abc.ABC</span></code></p>\n<p>Abstract base class for data stores.\nProvides common functionality for different store implementations.</p>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.decrypt\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">decrypt</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">identifier</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">encrypted_data</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">T</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.decrypt\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Decrypt data after retrieval.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>identifier</strong> \u2013 Unique key used as part of encryption salt</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>encrypted_data</strong> \u2013 Encrypted data to decrypt</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>Decrypted data</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.delete\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">delete</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">identifier</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.delete\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Async<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p></p></dd>\n</dl>\n<p>Delete data by identifier.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>identifier</strong> \u2013 Unique key for the stored data</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>options</strong> \u2013 Additional operation-specific options</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.encrypt\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">encrypt</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">identifier</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">state_data</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">T</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.encrypt\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Encrypt data before storing.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>identifier</strong> \u2013 Unique key used as part of encryption salt</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>state_data</strong> \u2013 Data to encrypt</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>Encrypted string representation of the data</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.get\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">identifier</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.get\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Async<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p></p></dd>\n</dl>\n<p>Retrieve data by identifier.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>identifier</strong> \u2013 Unique key for the stored data</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>options</strong> \u2013 Additional operation-specific options</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>The stored data or None if not found</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.set\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">set</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">identifier</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">state</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">T</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">remove_if_expires</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">False</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.set\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Async<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p></p></dd>\n</dl>\n<p>Store data with the given identifier.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>identifier</strong> \u2013 Unique key for the stored data</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>state</strong> \u2013 Data to store</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>remove_if_expires</strong> \u2013 Whether to auto-remove expired data</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>options</strong> \u2013 Additional operation-specific options</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>",
